<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">&nbsp;</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><B>Extraordinary General Meeting Results</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">On March 26, 2024, Gorilla Technology Group Inc.,
a Cayman Islands exempted company (the &ldquo;Company&rdquo;), held an Extraordinary General Meeting of Shareholders (the &ldquo;Extraordinary
Meeting&rdquo;). As of the close of business on February 29, 2024, the record date for the Extraordinary Meeting, 79,916,252 ordinary
shares of the Company were issued and outstanding and entitled to vote on each proposal at the Extraordinary Meeting.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">Set forth below are the proposals voted on at
the Extraordinary Meeting and the final vote tabulation as certified by the Inspector of Election. Each proposal was described in greater
detail in the Company&rsquo;s Report of Foreign Private Issuer on Form 6-K filed with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission on March
7, 2024.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><B>Proposal 1 &ndash; Ordinary Resolution &ndash;
Approval of the Share Consolidation:</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">The shareholders voted to approve a share consolidation
of the Company&rsquo;s ordinary shares at a ratio of not less than two-for-one and not greater than twenty-for-one. The votes for, votes
against, votes abstained and broker non-votes are set forth below:</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE CELLSPACING="0" CELLPADDING="0" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse">
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="border-bottom: Black 1.5pt solid; width: 24%; text-align: center"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt"><B>FOR</B></FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="padding-bottom: 1.5pt; width: 1%">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="border-bottom: Black 1.5pt solid; width: 24%; text-align: center"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt"><B>AGAINST</B></FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="padding-bottom: 1.5pt; width: 1%">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="border-bottom: Black 1.5pt solid; width: 24%; text-align: center"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt"><B>ABSTAIN</B></FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="padding-bottom: 1.5pt; width: 1%">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="border-bottom: Black 1.5pt solid; width: 25%; text-align: center"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt"><B>BROKER NON-VOTES</B></FONT></TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top; background-color: rgb(204,238,255)">
    <TD STYLE="text-align: center"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">23,538,321</FONT></TD>
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: center"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">17,832,065</FONT></TD>
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: center"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">0</FONT></TD>
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: center"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">N/A</FONT></TD></TR>
  </TABLE>
<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><B>Proposal 2 &ndash; Ordinary Resolution &ndash;
Approval of an increase in the Company&rsquo;s authorized share capital:</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">The Extraordinary Meeting was adjourned with respect
to the proposal to increase the authorized share capital of the Company. The Extraordinary Meeting will reconvene to consider this proposal
at 9:00 a.m. ET on April 18, 2024.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"></P>

